OL,3,APolanski failed to show leadership over
OL,4,AZionism motion, ex-Green leader says
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the wake of the vote, Polanski has
OL,7,Fsaid he will not accept anyone being
OL,8,Fexcluded from the Green Party "because
OL,9,Fof the religious or communal body they
OL,10,Fare part of".
